window.products.push({"id":752051,"name":"Kitchen Shears, CFONRUAI Heavy Duty Kitchen Scissors, Poultry Shears with Cover, 4MM Thick Stainless Steel Sharp Cooking Scissors, Multipurpose Scisso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eZAs2lqdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✂【 PREMIUM QUALITY】This kitchen scissors are made of 3CR13 Stainless steel. With its low carbon content and a decent amount of chromium, added, this kitchen scissor has good stainless steel with decent corrosion resistance. It sharpens very easily and is very resistant to chipping and breaking. this kitchen scissor is very robust steel that does not chip or break easily. and the kitchen shear has extra-thick blades (4MM thicker than any other kitchen shears)for strength and durability. ✂ 【SUPER-SHARP BLADE】kitchen shears heavy duty has extra-thick blades (4MM thicker than any other kitchen shears)for strength and durability, The blades of this heavy-duty kitchen scissors are made of premium stainless steel, which has strong rust and corrosion resistance. They are ultra-sharp and can perform high precision cutting with minimal effort. ✂ 【ERGONOMIC & ADJUSTABLE SCREW HANDLE】CFONRUAI professional kitchen shears have an adjustable screw for tightening or loosening tension. Without an adjustable screw, the blades may be loose at the pivot and pop apart when exerting pressure. Besides, a double handle reinforcement screw makes the handle more sturdy, durable, and not easy to break. Made of aluminum alloy handles, which are stronger and more stable than ordinary ABS handles. ✂ 【MULTIPURPOSE COOKING SCISSORS】The multipurpose kitchen shears are a great all-around choice for daily use and an excellent value. You can indeed cut up a lot of things with these such as bacon, shrimp, fish, herbs, dried fruits, tomatoes, and even softer bones. You can also use these shears for a lot of different use such as trimming flowers, cutting twine, cardboard, or several different for crafts and domestic chores. ✂ 【TOP PERFORMANCE GUARANTEE】We will reply to you within 24h if you have any problem. Come with One Year Hassle-Free Replacement and Lifetime Limited Warranty. Helpful tips: Please cleaning after use, wipe off the water and keep dry to prevent rust. Hand washing is recommended in order to keep the blade edges sharp. Thanks to the CFONRUAI kitchen scissors heavy duty lifetime satisfaction guarantee, this is a 100% risk - free purchase, so don't hold back! Place and order NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eZAs2lqdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CFONRUAI","source_asin":"B08R2W6YL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R2W6YL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R2W6YL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
