window.products.push({"id":752185,"name":"Butter Bell - The Original Butter Bell crock by L Tremain, a Countertop French Ceramic Butter Dish Keeper for Spreadable Butter, Antique Collection, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718pR4OGeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A TOUCH OF PROVENCAL RUSTIC CHARM – The popular Antique collection of Butter Bell crocks draw inspiration from a French country kitchen, with intricate embossing on each butter keeper that resembles the leaves and crawling vines of a French vineyard, giving the butter crock a well-worn vintage appearance. Conveniently sized for optimal butter freshness, the crock is easy to handle and fits neatly on your countertop. DURABLE HIGH-QUALITY CERAMICS ENSURE LONGEVITY – The Butter Bell crocks are made from a proprietary, high-grade ceramic mixture called New Bone China. This liquid clay mixture is poured into pre-cast plaster molds, then allowed to set for several hours. When dry, the butter containers are carefully removed from their molds, glazed, and fired at 2200 degrees to create a beautiful, scratch resistant finish. The crocks contain NO lead or cadmium and are backed by a 2-year limited warranty. THE ORIGINAL AND THE BEST FOR 25 YEARS – Modeled after the original French beurrier, the Butter Bell crock by L. Tremain keeps butter fresh and spreadable for weeks without refrigeration, spoilage or odors. The two-piece design features an inverted bell-shaped lid and crock base for serving butter at the table, while protecting and storing the butter after each use. EASY TO USE FOR ALL TYPES OF BUTTER – It’s so simple! Pour 1/3 cup of cold water into the base of the crock, then pack the lid FIRMLY with softened butter. Replace the lid into the base and you’re ready to go! An airtight seal protects and preserves butter’s delicate flavor and freshness. Each Butter Bell crock holds one stick or cube (1/2 cup or 125 grams) of your favorite brand of butter, or even your own homemade butter. Try adding fresh herbs or spices to make a delicious, flavored butter! ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY GIFT PACKAGING – Each Butter Bell crock is securely packaged in a specially designed, environmentally friendly, four-color gift box – the perfect choice for your gift giving holidays, birthdays or special occasions. For over a quarter century, consumers worldwide have been experiencing the pleasures of spreadable butter kept in this unique and time-honored serving dish for butter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718pR4OGeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butter Bell","source_asin":"B09WBKZRJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WBKZRJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WBKZRJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":752186,"name":"dolond Neck Fan, Portable Foldable Bladeless Neck Fans, Intelligent LED Digital Display, 3 Speeds Adjustable, 4000 mAh Rechargeable Battery, Folding U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vMaSfqsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【UPDATED FOLDING DESIGN】 The dolond portable fan has a bow knot's fold design that effectively prevents the hair from getting pinched. Foldable neck fan with headphone shaped bow, more stylish and versatile. Hands Free neck fan after folding, can be placed in the carry-on bag for storage. On hot summer days, a neck fan is your perfect companion. You can free your hands while exercising, cooking, doing housework, traveling, and enjoying the cool anytime and anywhere. 【SMART DIGITAL DISPLAY】The LED display on the side of the product has been upgraded to know the capacitance of the wearable personal fan so that it can be charged in time, and when you press the power button, it will show the speed L1/L2/L3. And equipped with 1M long Type-C charging cable. 【THREE WIND SPEEDS ADJUSTABLE】Equipped with 3 speeds for you to choose from, you can adjust the appropriate neck fans speed to suit your needs by repeatedly pressing the power button. First gear, breeze brushing face, refreshing experience; Two block refreshing double, sweep away sultry; Third gear, strong wind, instant coolness. Long press the speed to turn off the neck fan directly. 【4000mAh RECHARGEABLE BATTERY】 Neck fans portable rechargeable built-in 4000mAh lithium ion battery, large capacity battery can provide 3-18 hours of working time, depending on your choice of wind gear and use scenario.Portable neck fan for Disney, vacations, summer sports, mowing, and yard work! 【360° SURROUND AIR, LOW NOISE】 The personal cooling device usb neck fan is designed with dual air channels for stronger airflow. There is also an air outlet at the nape of the neck, allowing strong air flow through the channel so that you can feel the surrounding wind. While enhancing wind speed, it also reduces the noise brought by wind speed, so that we can enjoy the cool brought by the fan comfortably.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vMaSfqsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"dolond","source_asin":"B0C6Q569WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6Q569WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6Q569WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
