window.products.push({"id":752258,"name":"Sofa / Couch Cover Slipcover 3 Pc. Set = Sofa + Loveseat + Chair Covers / Slipcovers 3 Pcs SET Stripe Jacquard Fabric - DARK PURPLE Color (with Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MSX1pZ-CL._AC_.jpg","description":"Package Contains: Sofa + Love seat + Chair Slipcovers, Color: DARK PURPLE - (DIAMOND FLORAL PATTERN) Fabric: Jacquard, Stain resistance thin Jacquard fabric. Fits sofas that are up to 96\" in length and Love seats that are up to 74\" in length and Armchairs that are up to 40\" in length by 30\" in width, Care Instructions: Machine Was. Gentle Cycle. Wash dark color separately. Use non-chlorine bleach only. Tumble Dry Low. No ironing necessary. ### ADDITIONAL DESCRIPTION #### Package Contains: Sofa + Love seat + Arm Chair Slipcovers. This Slipcover set includes 3 separate covers: One Sofa/Couch cover = 3 Seater Couch One Love Seat cover = 2 Seater Couch One Arm Chair cover = 1 Seater Chair Color: PURPLE - (DIAMOND FLORAL PATTERN) Please look at the 2nd picture of the actual fabric and color in order to see the tone of this Dark Purple color. First Picture show a sofa covered with slipcovers, Second picture show the actual fabric color and pattern, Third picture show the size and shape of a sofa that this slipcover will fit, Fourth picture show the instructions page of how to fit a sofa slipcover in 4 steps. Fabric: Jacquard, Stain resistance thin Jacquard fabric, The Stripe pattern might be Vertical or Horizontal, every shipment might be different, We can not know or guarantee the direction of the pattern. Size: Fits sofas that are up to 96\" in length and Love seats that are up to 74\" in length and Armchairs that are up to 40\" in length by 30\" in width. Care Instructions: Machine Washable, Gentle Cycle, Wash dark color separately, Use non-chlorine bleach only, Tumble Dry Low, No ironing necessary. Available in 6 Colors: Beige, Brown, Burgundy, Gold, Purple, Sage Green.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MSX1pZ-CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orly'sDream","source_asin":"B003UXCWLO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UXCWLO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UXCWLO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
