window.products.push({"id":752500,"name":"Woodstock Chimes Woodstock Rainbow Makers Collection, Crystal Guardian Angel, 1'' Emerald May Crystal Guardian Angels Crystal Suncatchers for Outdoor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I-8iYK4jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A beautiful angel ornament, accented by an emerald green birthstone crystal, leads to an aurora borealis heart. The May Birthstone Angel Suncatcher makes a great, personal gift, specially chosen with the recipient in mind. Made in the UK from genuine Austrian crystals with a patented process that creates the most sparkle. Measures 3-inches in length (8.5-Inches with nickel-plated angel, silver finish plated brass chain). Woodstock Crystal Suncatchers - they do for light what our chimes do for sound. WOODSTOCK THE ORIGINAL MUSICALLY TUNED CHIME - Woodstock stands behind every product they make with a one-year warranty and a lifetime tuning guarantee on their musically tuned chimes. The first Woodstock Chime was created by Grammy award-winning musician Garry Kvistad from an aluminum lawn chair he found in a landfill. As a professional musician and instrument designer, he was fascinated by the Scales of Olympos, a 7th century pentatonic scale that can't be played on a modern piano. Garry had the idea to cut and tune the lawn chair chime tubes to the exact frequency of the ancient scale. The resulting Chimes of Olympos was the first Woodstock Chime and is still one of their bestselling windchimes. Garry and his wife Diane founded Woodstock Percussion, Inc. in 1979 and it remains based business in New York's Hudson Valley.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I-8iYK4jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woodstock Chimes","source_asin":"B00975C5NE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00975C5NE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00975C5NE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
