window.products.push({"id":752537,"name":"Advent H400 Heritage Series Dual 6.5\" 2-Way Tower Speaker, Silver/Black (Single) (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PY9M1F7NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Enjoy big sound with this Advent Heritage Dual 6.5\" Speaker Tower. Features shielded drivers for use with video screens, two 6.5\" cellulose woofers, 1\" silk dome tweeter, 35Hz - 30kHz frequency response and capacity for 175 watts of RMS power. Amazon.com Give your home theater system a strong foundation with this two-way tower speaker from Advent. Designed for use as one of a pair of matched stereo speakers or a front speaker in a surround sound system, the H400 Heritage model features dual 6.5-inch cellulose woofers and a 1-inch soft dome tweeter to create a crisp frequency response of 35 Hz to 30 kHz. The sound radiates from the speaker's versatile cast-aluminum enclosure, which not only contributes to the audio profile but also adds a high-tech yet comfortable appeal to a room's décor. The speaker's height and driver spacing are designed to give listeners a good starting point toward optimum imaging and frequency response. However, users can also experiment with a wide variety of locations, as the H400 is equally at home on the floor or a short bookshelf (though locating it at ear level typically produces the most realistic sound). The speaker is also video shielded, meaning you can store it near a TV without worrying about image distortion or other hazards. And with a power rating of 10 to 175 watts, it should work with most amplifiers. The speaker measures 7.37 by 37.5 by 12.12 inches (W x H x D) and is covered by a five-year warranty on parts and labor. To create the most natural-sounding surround system, pair these speakers with other models in the Heritage line, which includes tonally matched rear bookshelf speakers and a center channel speaker. What's in the Box One H400 tower speaker, user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PY9M1F7NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Audiovox","source_asin":"B0002L5994","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002L5994","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002L5994","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
