window.products.push({"id":752577,"name":"CANYHEIO Kids Alarm Clock Ok to Wake Clock Sleep Training Clock for Kids with Night Light Sleep Sound Machine and Wake Up Light for Toddlers Boys Girl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615qewGdlVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰ 【Sleep training clock makes kids sleep better with ease】Little kids have not yet formed the concept of time, this toddler clock is designed to teach them when to go to bed and when to get up! And it's intergrated with all the necessary features，which is easy to operated for anyone, to help your child sleep better and wake up refreshed! With this ok to wake clock for kids，going to bed and waking up on time for a long period of time can help kids cultivate regular routine and relieve the unnecessary burden of parents. 🔗 【How it works】 As the set time is reached, corresponding sun/moon icon and light of this wake up clock for kids will be on, to wake up children or remind them to go to bed. And display brightness of ok to wake toddler clock is dimmable, which is cozy for eyes and easy to read, no matter day or night. 🐱 【Cute animal-like appearance】 We believe most people would love cute little animal. This kids alarm clock has a cute animal-like appearance, versatile in various rooms. As this cute alarm clock has a pair of cat ears, which can glows in darkness, kids can barely resist the charm of this kid clock, an aesthetic and practical decoration in the bedroom. 🌟 【Splendid night light】 With dazzling lights reflected in kids' eyes, children seem to be attracted. This kid alarm clock can emit 5 kinds of lights, 1 loop color and 4 single colors. Besides, there should be no worry about too bright light causing insomnia, as this toddler alarm clock have 4 levels of brightness adjustment to satisfy every kid, so that parents can spend less effort to put kids to bed. 🎹 【Soft sounds to accompany kids every night】 Children are always active and have trouble sleeping at night, seemingly needing something to hold their attention. The kids clocks for bedrooms can promote children’s sleep by 7 types of sleeping sounds. Besides, this kids digital clock has 4 volume levels so kids can choose the most appropriate volume from these. Sinking into a deep sleep with relaxing sound of clock for kids, end one day's upset, and look forward to the next day! 🎁 【An exquisite and thoughtful gift】 In the face of a wide range of gift-giving options during the many holidays, this kids clock could be a good choice for its well-designed cute appearance and versatile functions. With this kids clock ok to wake, children will behave themselves, while parents will have more spare time and private space with the help of this digital clock for kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615qewGdlVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANYHEIO","source_asin":"B0BYNWVSQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYNWVSQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYNWVSQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
