window.products.push({"id":752584,"name":"FLOVE Artificial Sunflower Bouquet, 16PCS 4inches and 24PCS 1.6inches Silk Sunflower Heads Fake Yellow Artificial Flowers for Table Decoration, Home D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R45JTtfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLOVE 4 Bundles * 10 Brunches Artificial Silk Sunflowers with Stems Sunflowers symbolize adoration, loyalty and longevity. Much of the meaning of sunflowers stems from its namesake, the sun itself. These flowers are unique in that they have the ability to provide energy in the form of nourishment and vibrancy—attributes which mirror the sun and the energy provided by its heat and light. Product Features: Material: Silk Flower and leaves; Plastic Stems. Fake Sunflowers Bouquet Length: 11.8 inches Diameter of Sunflower: 4 inches for big sunflowers, 1.6 inches for small sunflowers Package Weight: 0.3lb Occasion: Artificial silk sunflowers for vase, desktop decoration, wedding decoration, bride holding flowers, sunflower table decoration, faux flowers for home decoration porch window wedding garden backyard balcony farmhouse decor Packing Detail: 4 Bundles Artificial Sunflowers Bouquet Arrangement and Clean Tips for Artificial Flowers: * 1. We will fold the artificial sunflower bouquets according to the size and shape when packing. Please blow the flower heads with hair dryer to make them bloom.* 2. Since all the artificial yellow flowers are handmade, they may fall off during the transportation. Please just re-insert them by yourself. It won't affect the function and overall looking.* 3. Slight deformation at flowers or leaves due to transportation can be recovered easily by manual adjustment. And if the stems are bend during transit, please fix it back by bending back. * 4. FLOVE artificial flowers are made by hand and machine. Sometimes there is a little glue leave on the flower or leave, please just cut or remove it. * 5. There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time, please use hair dryer to blow off the dust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R45JTtfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLOVE","source_asin":"B08J3W9TQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J3W9TQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J3W9TQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
