window.products.push({"id":752616,"name":"3D silicone Buddha head candle mold pillar cylinder soap mould 3''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j-cJ0bkpL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This product may come with a different color. 1 Handmade silicone Buddha head mold for sale, made to order.  The cavity is about 3'' tall, 2'' in diameter, can make a 4 oz candle. This 3D mold comes with 2 cuts, before pouring, line the cuts well especially inside and tighten it with a rubber band, when it's ready to demold, take off the rubber band, gently open the mold and take out your Buddha head, you are done. No release agent is needed.  Important note:  1. Don't try to take out your candle/soap when it's still warm, you may ruin the details (the eyes, the ears, the nose...), please wait patiently until it gets cool, you may accelerate the process by setting it in freezer for a few minutes. 2.before pouring in the liquid, just remember to line the cuts very well and tighten the mold with a rubber band. 3. This is a handmade product, I won't be able to guarantee that every mold would look exactly the same. But each one is made with great care, we try our best to give it a great look. and newly made mold does has a slight silicone smell since we don't use chemical to get rid of it like the factories do, but it would go away after a while and it doesn't affect it's function at all. 4. Not suggest to use for food.  To extend the lifetime of this mold, I recommend :  1.to pour your wax/soap at the right temperature. 2. not to use it under extreme condition (baking or freezing long ), a few minutes wouldn't hurt though )  3. not to use extreme pressure/ strength on it, you may tear/break the mold.  The last, but not the least, use it the right way, and enjoy the easy way of making your homemade candles/soaps. If you are buying more than 4, please ask for a better shipping price. Questions are welcome. Thanks for looking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j-cJ0bkpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Handmade Charm","source_asin":"B07JNQBKNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNQBKNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNQBKNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":752617,"name":"CafePress Mockingbird Large Mug Ceramic Coffee Mug, Tea Cup 15 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQkuj9ldL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The smooth, white ceramic and easy-grip handle feels great in your hand as you sip your morning brew, afternoon tea or evening hot chocolate. Use our 15oz mug at home or in the office as a pen holder, displaying the funny or cute design. The design is professionally printed, making it the perfect novelty gift for both men and women, young or old. And taking care of this coffee mug is a cinch, as it can be used in the dishwasher or microwave. With CafePress, your satisfaction is always our promise...buy with confidence, as we offer easy returns and exchanges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQkuj9ldL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B088QMQHQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QMQHQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QMQHQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
