window.products.push({"id":752630,"name":"BeeGreen Laundry Backpack Bag 115L Heavy Duty Extra Large,Portable Durable Laundry Backpack With Padded Shoulder Strap & Front Pocket, Hanging Hamper ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vS0f3gdvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ROUND BOTTOM & 2-WAY CLOSURE: Our black laundry backpack has a round bottom, which ensures a more accommodating space after storage, it stands well. The extra handle at the top makes it easier to hang it up. We design a drawstring closure on the mouth top,combined with a strap with a buckle which helps to avoid spilling. PADDED ADJUSTABLE STRAP & LARGE FRONT POCKET: The adjustable shoulder straps with padding fit a wide variety of people and are designed for easy carrying and transportation. The front pocket (measures W11.25\"x H15\" x 1.5\") provides extra storage space for laundry detergent soap, underwear, or socks. DURABLE MATERIAL & EXTRA LARGE VOLUME: Measures 28\"H X 15\"L. Our laundry bag backpack adopts a retractable design, the maximum extension height is 40\"， and the capacity can reach 115L. The portable washable laundry bag is made of heavy-duty Oxford cloth, which is lightweight . Cross stitching on the straps and further sewn with reinforced stitches on all sides to improve durability. MULTI-PURPOSE USE: The travel laundry bag is suitable for a dorm or apartment living where laundry needs to be transported. You can also use it as storage bags for blanket or other stuff. Hands-free carrying makes the laundry bag with strap perfect as a travel bag for hiking, camping, or picnics.Laundry bags can be a college dorm room essentials. COLLAPSIBLE FOR EASY STORAGE & MACHINE WASHABLE: The heavy duty laundry backpack is also collapsible that you can easily fold and store in any drawer when not used. And they are Machine Washable rather than by hand which will save your time and promotes reuse. Recommend Mild Detergent and Hang to Dry!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vS0f3gdvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B09TVHCZ6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVHCZ6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVHCZ6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
