window.products.push({"id":752971,"name":"Fourth Level Manufacturing 33\" Hamsa,Sacred Geometry Wall Decor for Home, Meditation Decor,Wall Sculpture, All Natural Wood Wall Decor Sacred Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hgahy-2oL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Multipurpose Decor- Any home, office, exercise, or spiritual room will benefit from the display of our unique home wall decor. The traditional, mythical status the Hamsa represents makes it an awesome and awe-inspiring complement to any area where you meditate, but its decorative qualities make it a perfect fit for any room you choose. High Quality - We've made sure to use only the finest materials in constructing this unique, spiritual symbol. We use laser technology to ensure flawless carving and our wooden wall art decor is crafted with durable materials that will last. Every Zen decor is inspected to ensure our high-quality standards, so you can be assured that your above wall decor is flawless. GET CRAFTY: Take your creativity to the next level! The raw wood allows so much room for artistic expression and spiritual wall art: Paint it, varnish it, play with it any way you want! Also works great as a stencil given its sturdiness, making it multi-use compared to other stencils that use a flimsier material. Perfectly Sized - Our Hamsa is the perfect-sized meditation decor to complement whichever space you choose. The hamsa wall decor measures 33 inches, making it easy to hang and fit in with the ambiance of your space. Excellent Gift - Our hamsa is perfect for anyone who likes traditional art, spiritual pieces, or who appreciates well-made crafts. Really, it's a great gift for anyone who appreciates spiritual decor, which makes it an ideal gift for any holiday, birthday, housewarming, or any event that you can think of. Our buddha decor not only offers elegance but the feeling of tranquility and protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hgahy-2oL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fourth Level Manufacturing","source_asin":"B08TMR7S5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMR7S5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMR7S5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":752972,"name":"Silit Wok-Set 2-Piece Uncoated Ø 36cm Black Made in Germany Pouring Rim Glass Lid Stainless Steel Handle Silargan Functional Ceramic Suitable for Indu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nMMee11CL._AC_SL1018_.jpg","description":"Become a professional cook with WMF’s Profi pan series. The timelessly elegant and permanently shiny stainless steel pans are made from WMF’s patented, highly durable Cromargan. The advantages of this are manifold: Cromargan is extremely robust and dimensionally stable, hard-wearing, resistant to food acids and absolutely tasteless. The TransTherm universal base on the Profi pans evenly distributes heat and retains it for a long time. Give it your all: flash-fry meat, sweat onions and spray oil. Flip, stir, taste and become a master chef in your own kitchen. The edge of the frying and serving pans in the Profi series are designed in such a way that nothing spills over when filling or serving. Even with heavy use, the high-grade stainless steel pans will continue to impress for years to come with their shine, shape and function. This deep, spherical-shaped Silit pan with two handles mounted on opposite sides is a pot, steamer and deep fryer in one and is regarded as one of the most important cooking utensils in Asia. And we love it, too! Woks can be used not only for cooking authentic Asian-style dishes, but for steaming, stewing and braising all kinds of vegetables, meat and fish. The most popular cooking method is of course stir-frying, whereby ingredients are fried quickly over a high heat while continuously stirring. A lid keeps the steam in the wok when braising, while high-quality materials conduct the heat evenly inside the wok and retain it. Thanks to their stylish design, Silit woks are ideal for serving directly at the table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nMMee11CL._AC_SL1018_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silit","source_asin":"B004T1O6N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004T1O6N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004T1O6N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":752973,"name":"Lipper International Bamboo Wood Non-Slip Kitchen Cutting Board, Medium, 14\" x 9-1/2\" x 5/8\", Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IYd4bfnML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lipper International provides exceptionally valued items for the kitchen, home, office, and child's playroom. Known for their functionality and beauty, each of our products is individually crafted from the finest quality materials. This Non-Slip Bamboo Wood Cutting Board has bright silicone edges allow for easy-grip and non-slip functionality. The bamboo wood construction is naturally colored - not stained. Hand wash with a mild soap and cool water. Do not soak. Do not put in the dishwasher, microwave or refrigerator. Extreme changes in temperature will cause the material to crack over time. Dry thoroughly. Occasional use of mineral oil on the inside will help maintain its appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IYd4bfnML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipper International","source_asin":"B008EQAND6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-752973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008EQAND6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008EQAND6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
